[1464,1465,1466,1467],{"id":302,"depth":400,"text":303},{"id":343,"depth":400,"text":344},{"id":570,"depth":400,"text":571},{"id":585,"depth":400,"text":586},{"id":754,"depth":384,"text":755},{"id":814,"depth":384,"text":815},{"id":901,"depth":384,"text":902},{"id":934,"depth":384,"text":935},{"id":1060,"depth":384,"text":889},{"id":1213,"depth":384,"text":892},{"id":1253,"depth":384,"text":875},{"id":1373,"depth":384,"text":1374},{"id":1447,"depth":384,"text":1448},"A Vue DnD Kit tab in the Vue DevTools and the Nuxt DevTools — a live mini-map, a joystick that drags for real, live option editing and a log of every drag.","md",{},{"icon":116},{"title":113,"description":1477},"YMGbeJlyH8ZtJrivpnDc89RDvqds1hBDnxMwx8Sv_nQ",[1484,1486],{"title":108,"path":109,"stem":110,"description":1485,"icon":111},"How input becomes a drag — the pointer and keyboard sensors, activation constraints, canDrag, sensors of your own, and drags you script with @vue-dnd-kit\u002Factions.",{"title":118,"path":119,"stem":120,"description":1487,"icon":121},"The browser's own drag and drop, as drags of the library — files, links and text from other apps into drop targets and lists that make room for them, items dragged out of the page, and between windows of your app.",1793585129947]